@Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107

### Health checks

GET {{Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress}}/health

###

GET {{Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress}}/health/ready

###

GET {{Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Create transaction - Credit

POST {{Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Credit",
  "accountId": 1,
  "amount": 250.00,
  "createdBy": "Lucas Mendes"
}

### Create transaction - Debit

POST {{Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Debit",
  "accountId": 1,
  "amount": 42.50,
  "createdBy": "Lucas Mendes"
}

### Create transaction - validation error (missing fields)

POST {{Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": null,
  "accountId": null,
  "amount": null,
  "createdBy": "Lucas Mendes"
}

### Create transaction - validation error (invalid amount: zero, negative, too many decimals)

POST {{Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Debit",
  "accountId": 1,
  "amount": -10.555,
  "createdBy": "Lucas Mendes"
}

### Create transaction - validation error (unmapped field is rejected, not ignored)

POST {{Transaction.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Credit",
  "accountId": 1,
  "amount": 10.00,
  "createdBy": "Lucas Mendes",
  "unexpectedField": "should fail"
}
